  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I love that after so long we finallly have chatboxes in VRC, but from a visual standpoint I think it wouldn't hurt TOO bad to allow user's customize how their chatboxes appear via the SDK, allowing user's to create custom \"Chatbox themes\" that they can switch between and even share with other people like they would with avatars.\nImagine having a Runescape avatar for example and being able to have your textbox be like how it was back in Old School Runescape, or a speech bubble reminiscent of something like Phantasy Star Online, complete with SFX to make it more authentic. Just little things like that that can add flare and personality to a game already brimming with creativity and imagination.",
